  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "add the sliced onions and cook until they are translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "add the rice and caraway seeds to the skillet and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the vegetable broth, diced tomatoes, brandy, and white wine to the skillet. stir to combine.",
    "bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and cover the skillet with a lid.",
    "bake the pilaf in a papillote at 375°F (190°C) for 30 minutes.",
    "remove the pilaf from the oven and stir in the feta cheese and lemon juice.",
    "season the pilaf with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "serve the pilaf hot, garnished with fresh parsley."
  ],
